                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Yesterday I had a game vs a lvl14 player, while I am lvl3 after about 20 matches. This guy was good, he had troops I haven't seen before and after a long 30min battle he won by pushing away one of my troops with his support just to open the line of sight for his turret and deal exactly 4 health + some armor to my healer that killed it.\nHis turret was surrounded by 3 of my troops and it had 1hp left. \n\nTHIS GAME IS NOT P2W.\n\nA lot of people complain about game being slow, that is true, but being patient and waiting for your opponent to make tough decisions shouldn't be a bad thing. Time given for a turn is perfect, sometimes I barely have enough time to do everything I want. \nGame is not for everyone, but if you have a little bit of patience and won't rage quit just because you have to wait 30sec in turn based game - get it. It reminds me a lot of chess, you don't have to be aggressive or defensive, you need to balance it out and know what your troops are capable of.\n\nUI could use some improvements, but hey.. It's BETA\n\n\nGraphics: 10/10\nUI: 7/10\nMusic 9/10\nGameplay: 9/10\n\n",
